                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A personal childhood favourite and a much loved game today. The game is as mesmerizing and relaxing as watching real-world fish go about their fishy business, with a small sprinkling of entirely optional challenge that does not take away from its calming atmosphere. \r\n\r\nThe game is slow-paced even at its maximum speed, and you can expect to check in throughout the day and only play for maybe five minutes or so per session. Or, if you're like me, do every *productive* task within the span of five minutes or less, and stare at my fish for the next 30 minutes, ha! If you'd prefer a more active, fast-paced game, this probably isn't for you.",
